    "updated_at": "2024-01-25T23:40:20Z",
    "body": "Sorry for the delay - the issue is your `for=\"/\"` on the definition. Bikeshed is a touch inconsistent here, and doesn't allow that value to indicate an empty for *on a dfn*, only on a link. Remove it (or change it to `for=\"\"`), and it'll build correctly.",
